sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: In-Hand Object Detection
    
    actor Blind User
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant Pre as Image Pre-processor
    participant AI as AI Classifier
    participant TTS as Feedback Service

    Blind User->>Cam: Holds object in front of camera
    Cam->>Pre: Send Full Frame
    
    activate Pre
    Pre->>Pre: Crop Center 40% (Focus Area)
    Pre-->>AI: Send Cropped Image
    deactivate Pre
    
    activate AI
    AI->>AI: Classify Object (MobileNet/YOLO)
    AI-->>TTS: Result: "Soda Can"
    deactivate AI
    
    TTS->>Blind User: "Soda Can"
